Changed: IBTK::FACPreconditionerStrategy implementations must provide
fillGhostCellsNoCoarse(), which refreshes same-level and physical-boundary
ghosts while preserving coarse-fine interpolation data. W-, F-, and FMG-cycles
and V-cycles with presmoothing now require a level range starting at zero.
<br>
(Boyce Griffith, 2026/09/25)
